/v1/","context":{"app_id":3328270,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-3328270","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:53:48Z","value":1,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5304600","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3328270-1847286114042790","game_id":"steam-3328270","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update – Interactive Light Switch & Atmospheric Improvements","summary":"I've continued refining the Desecrated Deck demo, this time focusing on environmental interaction, lighting behavior, and atmosphere within the Basement.With Steam Scream V Fest (October 26 – November 2) just around the corner, I've added a few new details to make the ritual feel even more immersive.What's New & ImprovedNew Interactive Light Switch: Players can now interact with an old-fashioned rotary light switch in the Basement, manually turning the room's lighting on or off before beginning ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T19:23:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042790","verified_at":"2026-10-26T00:24:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3328270-1847286114039192","game_id":"steam-3328270","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update – Redesigned Manual & Progression Fix","summary":"I've continued refining the Desecrated Deck demo based on early player feedback, focusing on making the ritual easier to understand while maintaining its unsettling atmosphere.Recent improvements include:Redesigned Ritual Manual: The previous text-heavy Manual has been replaced with a visual card guide. All Item Cards and Perk Cards now feature their original illustrations alongside short, atmospheric descriptions, making their effects much easier to recognize and understand.Manual Progression F","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T09:12:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039192","verified_at":"2026-10-24T10:06:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3328270-1846651706696343","game_id":"steam-3328270","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update – Improved Pentagram Guidance & Gameplay Refinements","summary":"The Desecrated Deck demo has received another update during Steam Next Fest (October 19–26)!I've continued refining the opening experience based on early player feedback, focusing on making the first steps of the ritual easier to understand without taking away the mystery.Recent improvements include:New Pentagram Interaction Hint: Players now receive an additional on-screen reminder to inspect the Pentagram after discovering the Manual, helping them understand how to begin the ritual.Smarter Con","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T18:17:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696343","verified_at":"2026-10-21T02:06:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3328270-1846651706692254","game_id":"steam-3328270","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update – Improved Player Guidance & Critical Bug Fix","summary":"I've continued refining the Desecrated Deck demo, focusing on making the opening experience more intuitive for first-time players.Following feedback from early playtesting, I've added a small improvement to help players better understand how to proceed during the opening sequence.Recent improvements include:New Controls Letter Hint: A new on-screen hint now appears after 10 seconds if the player hasn't interacted with the Controls Letter. It explains which keyboard or controller button to press ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:53:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692254","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3328270-1846651706687850","game_id":"steam-3328270","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update – New Level Selection, Ghost Reactions & Final Polish","summary":"The Desecrated Deck demo has received another update, just one day before Steam Next Fest begins!I've continued refining the demo, adding new atmospheric details, expanding the main menu, and making further gameplay improvements.Recent improvements include:New Level Selection Menu: The main menu now features a level selection screen. While the Basement remains the only playable location in the demo, the Graveyard and Attic are now visible as locked locations, offering a small glimpse of what's p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T19:32:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687850","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3328270-1846651706683393","game_id":"steam-3328270","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update – Camera Tracking, Gameplay Hints & Further Improvements","summary":"I've continued refining the demo, focusing on improving visual feedback, making gameplay instructions more accessible, and addressing issues discovered during testing.Recent improvements include:Improved Camera Tracking: The camera now automatically follows nearly all important card interactions, including Item Card reveals, attacks, Life Card losses, and defensive Perk Card effects. This makes it much easier to follow the action, understand how different cards interact, and see exactly what's h","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T23:33:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706683393","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3328270-1846651706675654","game_id":"steam-3328270","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update – Clearer Instructions & Further Improvements","summary":"The Desecrated Deck demo has received another update as Steam Next Fest approaches!I've been continuing to refine the demo, focusing on making the gameplay experience more intuitive, improving visual guidance, and addressing issues reported by players.Recent improvements include:Clearer In-Game Guidance: Additional on-screen instructions now help players better understand what to do next, particularly during the opening stages of the ritual.Improved Camera Tracking: The camera now automatically ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T21:32:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675654","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3328270-1846018067944869","game_id":"steam-3328270","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update – Audio Settings & Further Improvements","summary":"The Desecrated Deck demo has received another update as Steam Next Fest approaches!I've been continuing to refine the demo, addressing technical issues and making improvements based on player feedback to ensure a smoother and more enjoyable experience.Recent improvements include:New Master Volume Slider: Players can now adjust the overall game volume directly through the Options menu.Save System Adjustments: For the time being, save data will automatically reset whenever the game is restarted. T","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T17:25:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067944869","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3328270-1846018067938026","game_id":"steam-3328270","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Updates – Polishing for Steam Next Fest","summary":"The Desecrated Deck demo has received several updates over the past few days!I've been actively working on improving the demo, releasing multiple updates to make the gameplay more intuitive, accessible, and enjoyable.Recent improvements include:Clearer gameplay instructions and visual guidance to help new players understand the ritual.Bug fixes and refinements to improve the overall experience.Adjustments based on valuable feedback from players who have already tried the demo.With Steam Next Fes","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T09:00:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938026","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3328270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:24:51Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:24:51Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3328270":"2026-10-26T00:24:51Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3328270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:24:51Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:24:51Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5304600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:24:51Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:24:51Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3328270","app_id":3328270,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:17Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService